Add inside a `@media (max-width: 760px)` block placed after line 168:
```
.landed { padding: 18px 18px 20px; }
.landed > p:not(.eyebrow) { display: none; }
.landed .eyebrow { letter-spacing: .16em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.landed h2 { font-size: 1.9rem; margin-bottom: 0; }
.landed__row { flex-wrap: nowrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 14px; }
#again { font-size: 0; gap: 0; padding: 0; width: 46px; flex: none; }
```
The `#again` rule turns 'Toss again' into an icon-only button; its text stays in the DOM, so screen readers still read it.

